   * @param {Menubar}        options.parentMenu              - The parent menu.
   * @param {boolean}        [options.isSubmenuItem = false] - A flag to mark if the menu item is controlling a submenu.
   * @param {?Menubar}       [options.childMenu = null]      - The child menu.
